const enumParameters={Estimator:[['球面距离',0],['立方体距离',1]],Axis:[['X',0],['Y',1],['Z',2]],Target:[['向量 z',0],['常量 c',1]],Mode:[['幂半径平方',0],['最大轴',1],['当前半径',2]]};
const flagParameters=new Set(['Canonical','Julia','nonconformal','Squared']);
function el(tag,text,cls){const node=document.createElement(tag);if(text!==undefined)node.textContent=text;if(cls)node.className=cls;return node;}
function button(text,action,label){const b=el('button',text);b.type='button';if(label)b.setAttribute('aria-label',label);b.onclick=action;return b;}
function currentNode(id){return workspace.active.graph.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id);}
function parameterWidget(nodeId,def,place){
 const ownerId=workspace.activeId,[key,label,min,max,step]=def,row=el('div',undefined,'parameter-control'),line=el('div',undefined,'value-row'),lab=el('label',label);let input,range;
 row.dataset.key=key;row.dataset.node=nodeId;
 if(flagParameters.has(key)){input=el('input');input.type='checkbox';}
 else if(enumParameters[key]){input=el('select');for(const [name,value]of enumParameters[key]){const option=el('option',name);option.value=value;input.append(option);}}
 else{input=el('input');input.type='number';Object.assign(input,{min,max,step});range=el('input');range.type='range';Object.assign(range,{min,max,step});range.setAttribute('aria-label',label+' 滑杆');}
 input.id=place+'-'+nodeId+'-'+key;input.setAttribute('aria-label',label);lab.htmlFor=input.id;line.append(lab,input);row.append(line);if(range)row.append(range);
 const read=()=>input.type==='checkbox'?Number(input.checked):Number(input.value);
 function change(value){if(workspace.activeId!==ownerId)return;if(!Number.isFinite(value)||value<min||value>max||(step===1&&!Number.isInteger(value))){input.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true');connectionMessage(label+'：请输入 '+min+'–'+max+' 范围内的数值。');return;}try{const doc=workspace.active;doc.parameter(nodeId,key,value);input.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');syncParameter(nodeId,key);schedulePatch(nodeId,key,value);saveSoon();updateUndo();}catch(e){input.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true');connectionMessage(e.message);}}
 input.addEventListener('focus',()=>{if(workspace.activeId===ownerId)workspace.active.begin();});input.addEventListener('input',()=>{if(input.type!=='number'||(input.value!==''&&!input.validity.badInput))change(read());});input.addEventListener('blur',endParameterEdit);if(range){range.addEventListener('pointerdown',()=>workspace.active.begin());range.addEventListener('input',()=>change(Number(range.value)));range.addEventListener('change',endParameterEdit);}
 const binding={ownerId,nodeId,key,row,set(value){if(input.type==='checkbox')input.checked=!!value;else if(document.activeElement!==input)input.value=value;if(range&&document.activeElement!==range)range.value=value;}};fieldBindings.add(binding);binding.set(currentNode(nodeId)?.params[key]??def[5]);return row;
}
function syncParameter(nodeId,key){const value=currentNode(nodeId)?.params[key];for(const b of [...fieldBindings]){if(!b.row.isConnected){fieldBindings.delete(b);continue;}if(b.ownerId===workspace.activeId&&b.nodeId===nodeId&&b.key===key)b.set(value);}}
function endParameterEdit(){workspace.active?.end();updateUndo();saveSoon();}
function advancedOpen(open=true){C('composer-inspector').hidden=!open;C('toggle-inspector').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));if(open)renderInspector();scheduleWires();}
function renderInspector(){
 const pane=C('node-inspector');pane.replaceChildren();const doc=workspace.active;pane.append(el('h2',doc.graph.name));const name=el('input');name.className='inspector-name';name.value=doc.graph.name;name.maxLength=80;name.setAttribute('aria-label','文档名称');name.onchange=()=>renameDocument(name.value);pane.append(name);
 const node=doc.graph.nodes.find(n=>doc.editor.selection.includes(n.id));
 if(node){const def=G.types[node.type];pane.append(el('h2',node.label||def?.label||node.type),el('p',def?.description||'缺失或不支持的算子版本；原数据会保留在项目草稿中。'));const title=el('input');title.value=node.label||'';title.placeholder=def?.label||node.type;title.className='inspector-name';title.maxLength=80;title.setAttribute('aria-label','节点名称');title.onchange=()=>editGraph(g=>{g.nodes.find(n=>n.id===node.id).label=title.value;},{math:false});pane.append(title);
  for(const port of def?.inputs||[]){const label=el('label','输入 '+port,'input-connection'),select=el('select');const empty=el('option','未连接');empty.value='';select.append(empty);for(const n of doc.graph.nodes.filter(n=>n.id!==node.id&&n.type!=='formula-output')){const opt=el('option',(n.label||G.types[n.type]?.label||n.type)+' · '+n.id);opt.value=n.id;select.append(opt);}select.value=doc.graph.edges.find(e=>e.to===node.id&&e.port===port)?.from||'';select.setAttribute('aria-label','输入 '+port+' 的上游节点');select.onchange=()=>{if(select.value)connect(select.value,node.id,port);else editGraph(g=>{g.edges=g.edges.filter(e=>e.to!==node.id||e.port!==port);});};label.append(select);pane.append(label);}
  for(const d of def?.params||[]){pane.append(parameterWidget(node.id,d,'advanced'));const published=doc.graph.parameters.some(p=>p.nodeId===node.id&&p.key===d[0]),publish=button(published?'已公开为公式参数':'公开为公式参数',()=>togglePublic(node.id,d),'公开 '+d[1]);publish.className='publish-parameter';publish.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(published));pane.append(publish);}
  const actions=el('div',undefined,'inspector-actions');actions.append(button('复制节点',()=>duplicateSelection()),button('删除节点',removeSelection));pane.append(actions);
 }else pane.append(el('p','选择节点查看高级参数。常用参数可以直接在节点内调整。'));
 const settings=el('details');settings.append(el('summary','预览与渲染设置'));for(const key of ['Bounds','StepScale','DetailPrecision','NormalFilter','Exposure','KeyIntensity','Roughness','BlueRoughness']){const d=graphPreviewDefinition(key);if(!d)continue;const row=el('label',d[1],'input-connection'),input=el('input');input.type='number';Object.assign(input,{min:d[2],max:d[3],step:d[4],value:doc.preview.settings?.[key]??preview.settings[key]});input.setAttribute('aria-label',d[1]);input.oninput=()=>{const value=Number(input.value);if(!Number.isFinite(value)||value<d[2]||value>d[3])return;doc.preview.settings??={};doc.preview.settings[key]=value;preview.setSettings({[key]:value});saveSoon();};row.append(input);settings.append(row);}pane.append(settings);
 const exportActions=el('div',undefined,'inspector-actions');exportActions.append(button('导出公式包',()=>exportFormula()),button('导出节点图',()=>exportGraph()));pane.append(exportActions);
}
function graphPreviewDefinition(key){return globalThis.GenlePreviewParameters?.find(d=>d[0]===key);}
